ted='selected' data-lang=\"{&quot;id&quot;:0,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;English&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;dir&quot;:0}\">English</option>\n309:             <!--<li class=\"hide-on-mobile\"><a href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/contact-us//\">Contact Us</a></li>-->         \r\n319:<div class=\"search-box\"><form  class=\"is-search-form is-form-style is-form-style-3 is-form-id-3166 \" action=\"https://srfti.ac.in/\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\" ><label for=\"is-search-input-3166\"><span class=\"is-screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span><input  type=\"search\" id=\"is-search-input-3166\" name=\"s\" value=\"\" class=\"is-search-input\" placeholder=\"Search here...\" autocomplete=off /></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"is-search-submit\"><span class=\"is-screen-reader-text\">Search Button</span><span class=\"is-search-icon\"><svg focusable=\"false\" aria-label=\"Search\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24px\"><path d=\"M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27C15.41 12.59 16 11.11 16 9.5 16 5.91 13.09 3 9.5 3S3 5.91 3 9.5 5.91 16 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z\"></path></svg></span></button><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"3166\" /></form></div> </div>\r\n377:                    <a role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/about-the-institute/\">About the Institute</a>\r\n493:                <a role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"0\"  href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/contact-us/\">Contact Us<!--<i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\" style=\"margin-left:10px;\"></i>--></a>\r\n514:        <h1 class=\"page-banner-title\">About the Institute</h1>\r\n520:    <nav aria-label=\"breadcrumbs\" id=\"breadcrumbs\"><ol><li><a href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/\">Home</a></li>  <li><a href=\"#\">About Us</a></li>  <li class=\"breadcrumb_last\" aria-current=\"page\">About the Institute</li></ol></nav>   </div>\r\n525:                <ul id=\"menu-english_admin_menu\" class=\"childnav-lists\"><li class=\"childnav-list-item active\"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/about-the-institute/\" aria-current=\"page\">About the Institute</a></li><li class=\"childnav-list-item \"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/about-ftii-itanagar/\">About FTII Itanagar</a></li><li class=\"childnav-list-item \"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/leadership/\">Leadership</a></li><li class=\"childnav-list-item \"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/management/\">Management</a></li><li class=\"childnav-list-item \"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/important-committees/\">Important Committees</a></li><li class=\"childnav-list-item \"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/organization-chart/\">Organization Chart</a></li><li class=\"childnav-list-item \"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/annual-reports/\">Annual Reports</a></li><li class=\"childnav-list-item \"><a class=\"item\" href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/directory/\">Directory</a></li></ul>            </nav>\r\n540:Film &#038; Television Institute (SRFTI) is the second national centre for cinema education in India. Established in 1995 by the Government of India as an autonomous academic institution under the Ministry of Information and Broadcasting, the Institute was subsequently registered under the West Bengal Societies Registration Act, 1961.</p>\n552:                        <p>The first academic session commenced on September 1, 1996. Since then, the Institute has been offering three-year postgraduate programmes in Cinema across six specialisations: Direction and Screenplay Writing, Editing, Cinematography, Sound Recording and Design, Producing for Film & Television, and Animation Cinema.\r\n553:<p>In 2017, the Institute launched the Electronic & Digital Media (EDM) wing, which offers two-year postgraduate programmes in Electronic and Digital Media in six specialisations:\r\n555:<p>SRFTI also conducts a variety of short-term courses in film appreciation, acting, library science, digital editing, and other areas. Despite its relatively short existence, the Institute has achieved significant success, prompting the development of new specialised practices and innovative courses.\r\n557:<p>Their achievements have not only brought distinction to the Institute but have also enhanced the reputation and acceptance of its current students in the highly competitive world of cinema.\r\n558:<p>On 22nd April 2025, the Ministry of Education awarded SRFTI the status of a Deemed to be University under a distinct category under Section 3 of the UGC Act, 1956.</p>                    </div>\r\n583:            <button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-01.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - foundation structure in progress\" class=\"single-image\"  ></button></li> \r\n584:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-02.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - workers and vehicles at the main block\" class=\"single-image\" ></button></li>\r\n585:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-03.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - unfinished modern-style buildings in the background, an open rocky ground with small plants\" class=\"single-image\"  ></button></li>\r\n586:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-04.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - courtyard under construction\" class=\"single-image\"  ></button></li>\r\n587:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-05.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - campus view with buildings and water tanks\" class=\"single-image\"  ></button></li>\r\n588:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-06.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - temporary construction huts and site equipment\" class=\"single-image\"  ></button></li>\r\n589:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-07.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - corridor with two people walking\" class=\"single-image\"  ></button></li>\r\n590:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-08.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - service area with pipeline installations\" class=\"single-image\"  ></button></li>\r\n591:            <li><button class=\"gallery-btn\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/foundation-09.jpg\" alt=\"Construction of the Institute - elevated view of main stairway and water tank\" class=\"single-image\"></button></li>\r\n608:       style=\"width: 100%;\" style=\"width: 100%;\" controls loop muted aria-label=\"Introductory video showcasing our Institute.\">\r\n640:      <h2>Satyajit Ray Film & Television Institute</h2>\r\n645:        <p>email: contact[at]srfti[dot]ac[dot]in</p>\r\n656:                    <li><a href=\"https://srfti.ac.in/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></li>\r\n690:        <li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/school/satyajit-ray-film-and-television-institute-srfti/\" target=\"_blank\"  aria-label=\"Visit linkedin of SRFTI\" onclick=\"return check_url();\"><i class=\"fab fa-linkedin-in footer_icon\"></i></a></li>\r\n695:        <li><a href=\"https://www.india.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"External Link that opens in new window\" onclick=\"return check_url();\"><img src=\"https://srfti.ac.in/wp-content/themes/srft-theme/images/indiaportal-1.png\" alt=\"India Government Portal\"></a>\r\n698:      <a href=\"https://mib.gov.in/\" targ